830
01:13:17,307 --> 01:13:20,047
Almanya ile Versailles.

831
01:13:21,087 --> 01:13:22,827
Lütfen Versailles'i ayrıca arkadaşlar,

832
01:13:22,947 --> 01:13:24,127
